From ab277cfc3d2867c8c7c96a0adee8d0a0c9f1302b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChopGimp <mathieu.redon@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:21:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 175/177] ChopGimp 4.1.0: established features without their
 switches (fast load, fast drag, drag sprite, fast undo, fast babl, parallel
 render, live paint throttle, objects recolor and hover tip, behind modes and
 layers, fused styles, XCF effects cache, drafts): the old code paths are
 removed

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
